{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"30dce292ee109f89f510984b0545ee1379b0d37beee86f8f6e9469b89bc1700a","ja":"ごちそうさまでした～！\nハンバーガー、すっごくおいしかったね！","zh":"多谢款待～！\n汉堡真的超级好吃呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"262f4352a6b79893c685627f3d7f53ffd3cffc7e15b3bc5dcb5d0a367fdd1129","ja":"外で食べたから、いつもより美味しく感じたのかもね？\n今日はあたたかいし、風も気持ちいいから。","zh":"也许是因为在外面吃，感觉比平时更美味吧？\n今天天气暖和，微风吹着也很舒服。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1f80785a634fee788e18f1b08917bb5ecf5e6e3a904b912ac7c7dc480b3a3898","ja":"そうだね……あっ！　じゃあ本番は、\nもっと涼しい日のほうがいいのかなー？","zh":"确实呢……啊！那正式演出，\n选在更凉快的日子会不会更好呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5aad9484a1752fdbf19b25e0884700dee3ce99ef9f7ffd2cf0f7085e22950742","ja":"……？　どうして？\nあったかい方がいいんじゃないの？","zh":"……？为什么？\n温暖一点不是更好吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"a6c4714a32fb43f7da5e2c4d7e794b150ef5aa0026289b8d4c00bab98eb1a2ad","ja":"えっ！　それは、えーっと……。","zh":"欸！那个，呃……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a1d54045f15b0c523ae39ddaffcf1d89b7e27c0ee7998372c0339ab0ba327bb0","ja":"……あっ。い、伊織さん、これ。よかったら食べて。\nやよいさんに教えてもらったレシピで作ったんだ。","zh":"……啊。伊、伊织，这个。不介意的话尝尝看吧。\n是我用向弥生学来的食谱做的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"d7a2ffb1146d694522fa2ef37ebeafe9fa7b3c8d9119bbbb78033d2c9df589f8","ja":"わあ～、おからクッキーだ！\n美味しそうだね。","zh":"哇～是豆渣饼干！\n看起来很好吃呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"3e109fd25c903528dbd564b24a51ceb892250f6b4b4e2ec668a0c36d58fb055f","ja":"あら、用意がいいじゃない♪","zh":"哎呀，准备得挺周到的嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b190b82483c46efefefc8931fc1ed0e6b1dfa21b1a5d37767585c13776b9c3b8","ja":"お仕事の休憩中に出そうと思ってたんだけど、\nタイミングがなかったんだ。やよいさんも、どうぞ。","zh":"本来想趁工作休息时拿出来的，\n但一直没找到合适的机会。弥生也请用吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"844decb80d74511c043f6c81406cc097f0c382fbb80d1789f61711db54bc96e2","ja":"ありがとう！　いただきま～す！\n……うん、すっごくおいしいよ！","zh":"谢谢！我开动啦～！\n……嗯，超级好吃哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7e5d0e9b6b05c40b1f8a092a09569c325bf8a0be1f26da4804173ef57c1d142c","ja":"甘さもちょうどいいわね。\nつい、食べすぎちゃいそうなくらいだわ♪","zh":"甜度也刚刚好呢。\n简直让人忍不住想要多吃一点了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"b044bebb7950e43b620b5b7c43ba00f3661b9002df3c92f97910c90989b97779","ja":"ありがとう。じゃああとは……\n運動もしないといけないよね。","zh":"谢谢你。那接下来……\n也必须得运动了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"90de4125201a3dc91fec2195fa777bbaa687547fb98fa130dc72547dd2047ef9","ja":"クッキーはヘルシーだけど、\nハンバーガーも食べたし。","zh":"饼干虽然很健康，\n但汉堡也吃过了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"734dca8bab21e2b9aaf73bbbc5ae1b1d6ef0ef3b5f623b04d947bf053684885d","ja":"あっちでバトミントンができるみたいだよ。\nみんなでやってみよ？","zh":"那边好像可以打羽毛球哦。\n大家一起玩玩看吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"67ca33114dd5fbc49472ad0be5098c4d6aa3838e9fc5e11058b54d9b1b03b320","ja":"ラケットとかを貸し出してるのね。いいじゃない。\nやりましょ。勝つのはもちろんこの伊織ちゃんだけど♪","zh":"有外借球拍之类的啊。挺不错的嘛。\n来玩吧。不过赢的当然会是我伊织就是了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1748.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"a098a490811d55d13827378acc20749c924ff169e765e2fed5fb28de3dbaa29f","ja":"桃子も負けないからね！","zh":"桃子也不会认输的哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
